# Fine-tuned LoRA adapter bundle for the local model (~145MB). GitHub hard-rejects
# files over 100MB, so a single `git add` of this would fail the next push. It is
# shared out of band (pendrive / Drive) - see docs/HELPER-README.md section 6.
pdsf/adapter.zip

# Local code-model pipeline outputs (docs/LOCAL-CODE-MODEL-PLAN.md). Work
